{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38892","headline":"馆舍秋夕 · 杜荀鹤","name":"馆舍秋夕","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寒雨萧萧灯焰青，灯前孤客难爲情。\n兵戈闹日别乡国，鸿鴈过时思弟兄。\n冷极睡无离枕梦，苦多吟有彻云声。\n出门便作还家计，直至如今计未成。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜荀鹤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38892.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38892","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}